#: scenario7:scenario7_F82E2626_05F1_49B0_B655_22D8351EAA85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10e093cdefaf91f00c10e84acd9f38dcf0b33c228ca8e423bf019378fd393bd9
#. default-sha256: 4b61990128d74a4c73ba4a0a3a2c5711a510098e1e112fd950cf039dc4daea1c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F82E2626_05F1_49B0_B655_22D8351EAA85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The archangel stood proudly upon "
"his glass perch,⟪k:12⟫looking down at me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫大天使は変わらずに、⟪k:12⟫尊大そうな"
"素振りで私を見下ろしている。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3685A8D2_76B9_410A_92EE_946FC39B311A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce21ad4337dc741b6cf3a60c642df6ca28e048ca59b57a380bdd00988105d3db
#. default-sha256: 55a6d2522bff5a1ca054910e938c199d29a03fc7856463a5610ad4aaaf95f566
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3685A8D2_76B9_410A_92EE_946FC39B311A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫His gaze almost seemed... ⟪k:1⟫judgmental."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あるいは、⟪k:1⟫私の行いを咎めるかのように……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2B06C58F_460D_4798_B82E_E24EB9845EA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4680b247859546a0a3ad0cc5a52000ae364ee151687d2a74285304957e5a1664
#. default-sha256: ae89fb65842355f9e8c8a5de4b6aee556a344db3e79064dcc7483f6513016847
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2B06C58F_460D_4798_B82E_E24EB9845EA2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But I marched for the tower, unconcerned."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫けれど、⟪k:1⟫私の足は止まらずに――塔へと向かっていた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_923AF344_9FE7_4626_B420_7B87C0EBD422
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3cd59bbba93832b89bbe571c125abdf62d103836af7586e6e7038903e6da1f3
#. default-sha256: b03c62715e2d800b1effa1f01602d9d7b3931862dd818a24de675acf120b74ce
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_923AF344_9FE7_4626_B420_7B87C0EBD422"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For the day someone would truly set me free."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私を本当の意味で解放する人を、⟪k:1⟫待ち続けていたんです。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_80B67623_550E_4CB4_8CB0_B22D8892A316
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29ca75a4ac13adcc534025cffa65ea1d1f347cd8d73e2a99d2d1c4ead0d8e9d4
#. default-sha256: d5639d585cb13dedcc316a6db810f41e969613a3ba8bf235f617f13c0a079d60
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_80B67623_550E_4CB4_8CB0_B22D8892A316"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That you were led here—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫that you were ⟪k:3⟫meant⟪k:4⟫ to come to this place."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あなたはきっと、⟪k:1⟫導かれるべくしてこの屋敷に来たんです。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_83BBBECD_3144_4476_8C30_E5D98FFBA6B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ef69468aad4dbb2092c6a125d7da959c24780fc2a46fb98d3241c77abbb6e56
#. default-sha256: 253691570eaf38f317bd597ea38d94830791f8488b2274fd8ee36fa27fb168b0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_83BBBECD_3144_4476_8C30_E5D98FFBA6B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I know how it feels to be locked up...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫to be tortured and used for others’ gain."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫閉ざされ――虐げられ――他人のための犠牲となり――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……その苦しみを、⟪k:3⟫私は分かっている。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_073CCD59_A5F1_4026_98A1_77E035B7B0DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d834898bc1e9e6b0eaa268cbe7e922871db61b48b4efa8c00843eeae6919ee6
#. default-sha256: 6232a0656564f4c15ca19a6452e328179161ff162354d0da3523a447e1457c13
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_073CCD59_A5F1_4026_98A1_77E035B7B0DA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and I shall be the only one to have compassion for you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私だけがあなたを慈しんであげましょう。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B32E596E_4255_43C7_A3F1_2A0BD187862D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 737be0447158cce678b29e85c87f88b8b791282598192e5ca5545e501c8fb51b
#. default-sha256: a9604064c3234ddc8adcb78025fe6652eb8bc3cbccf6cd715d0edabdd4d9b59c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B32E596E_4255_43C7_A3F1_2A0BD187862D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You were the only one to stay at my side..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あなただけが私の傍に居てくれたように……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2FEB5F5D_D126_46AD_92AA_E236698C8F5C
