#: scenario7:scenario7_CE2C3D9A_0F22_4351_83D0_38C93BCABC0D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a4b8b00173892bad5e00be911046608be85b7aecd08217655328e75d59f90e6
