#: scenario7:scenario7_D0B64B09_D6B4_4C40_BA6D_E640CE8A9F71
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac1f0edcebe9ac691498957ebb54994c4403a0206bc0cd18379cd3982fe3d0be
