msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Staring at the dancing flames, I was able to forget the passage of time. ⟪k:1⟫Watching, "
"unblinking, as the red-and-orange tongues flicked back and forth,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫炎の揺らめきを見ていると、⟪k:1⟫時間を忘れることが出来た。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫瞬きもせずにちろちろと揺れ"
"る火の指先を見ていると――"

